      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "client",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "If there is no final response for the original request in 64*T1 seconds (T1 is defined in Section 17.1.1.1), the client SHOULD then consider the original transaction cancelled and SHOULD destroy the client transaction handling the original request.",
